              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 1.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa ore anaa enatoduaa Isaya, “Te neme Olaitoriani loo lororani otelekaka iyiook nkera, anaata kitotiutuo anaa Sodom, neikoni iyiook anaa Gomora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkomono e Paulo te nkaraki Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aikijo aa naa iyiook? Iloreren leitu eing'oru ninche esupatisho ninche oonoto, naa to rrekie le nkirukoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake eji ore ninche Siraeli ooing'orutua esupatisho aa nekua kitanapat eitasheyie neitu eidim ninche aaitabai nena kitanapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aainyo? Enkaraki neitu eing'oru to rrekie le nkirukoto, kake etiu anaa too nkiaasin. Ketarrorrote te ilo soit orrorrisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 28.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anaa enatisiraki, “Ng'ura, nanu oirragie te Sion osoit orror iltung'ana, osoit kitok obatat ninche, kake ore oloiruk ninye nemeitukurruni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
